## 6. Guardrails preserved

The branch preserves these boundaries:

```text
runtime.mjs public export set unchanged
prompt() behavior unchanged
workerBridge unchanged
llama_worker unchanged
runtime/config unchanged
hardwareProbe unchanged
retryProfiles unchanged
configOverride unchanged
scheduler unchanged
request lifecycle unchanged
stream shaping unchanged
runtime/models unchanged
runtime/router unchanged
runtime/backends unchanged
runtime/execution unchanged
runtime/bus/executeAction unchanged
```

The new modules avoid imports of:

```text
runtime.mjs
workerBridge
llama_worker
node-llama-cpp
worker_threads
child_process
runtime/config modules
runtime lifecycle modules
runtime request modules
runtime stream modules
runtime router modules
runtime backend modules
runtime execution modules
```

The contract allows static metadata only. Request/execution payload keys remain rejected, including:

```text
modelPath
baseModel
mmprojPath
projectorPath
backendOptions
adapterArgs
rawBackendPayload
toolProcess
command
shell
exec
spawn
cwd
env
function
handler
execute
executeAction
invoke
workerBridge
llama_worker
nodeLlamaCpp
configOverride
```

Path-like values and raw model artifact references are rejected.

